              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Terry Matzke"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It's a good basic easy dish. I agree with some of the other reviews that it's a little too sweet. I'd cut at least a 1/2c and I'd add another cup of rubarb or make it in a smaller dish.",
